{"id":"6ac92fdbbf9c7872","group":"16","path":"16/16-lem-singleton-monic.md","title":"单元素映射单态性","display":"lem-singleton-monic — 单元素映射单态性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-lem-singleton-monic","aliases":["16-lem-singleton-monic","Singleton monicity"],"display":"lem-singleton-monic — 单元素映射单态性","depends_on":["[[16-df-singleton-map]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Lemma 5.4.4(i) pp.341–342 (PDF361–362); Exercise 5.4.3 p.345 (PDF365); local power-object generalization","revision_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-lem-singleton-monic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-lem-singleton-monic</span><span>Singleton monicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-singleton-monic — 单元素映射单态性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba3b191d87bb028c\" href=\"?note=ba3b191d87bb028c\" title=\"16-df-singleton-map\">16-df-singleton-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 5.4.4(i) pp.341–342 (PDF361–362); Exercise 5.4.3 p.345 (PDF365); local power-object generalization"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)\">\\(D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba3b191d87bb028c\" href=\"?note=ba3b191d87bb028c\" title=\"16-df-singleton-map\">16-df-singleton-map</a> 的数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 具有有限极限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的幂对象成员关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D\">\\(s_D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mem}_D\">\\(\\operatorname{Mem}_D\\)</span> 采用该定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y:J\\to I\">\\(x,y:J\\to I\\)</span> 是任意广义元素。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I))\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dy,x)\\Longleftrightarrow x=y\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(s_D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I))\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dy,x)\\Longleftrightarrow x=y\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(s_D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义中的方块把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_I\">\\(\\delta_I\\)</span> 表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D\\times\\operatorname{id}_I\">\\(s_D\\times\\operatorname{id}_I\\)</span> 的拉回。因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s_Dy,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s_Dy,x\\rangle\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 分解，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle y,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_I\">\\(\\delta_I\\)</span> 分解。后一条件等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:J\\to I\">\\(z:J\\to I\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=y\">\\(z=y\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=x\">\\(z=x\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span>。两向分解直接由拉回的泛性质得到，不需要足够多全局元素的假设。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_Du=s_Dv\">\\(s_Du=s_Dv\\)</span>，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=u\">\\(u=u\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Du,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Du,u)\\)</span>，替换相等箭头后有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dv,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dv,u)\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span>。这给出所有测试对象上的消去性，证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D\">\\(s_D\\)</span> 为单态。原书证明针对拓扑斯；以上证明把同一结论推广到有有限极限且该对象已有幂对象的范畴。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-singleton-map","status":"resolved","id":"ba3b191d87bb028c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-singleton-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-singleton-map","status":"resolved","id":"ba3b191d87bb028c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)$ 为 [[16-df-singleton-map]] 的数据；$\\mathcal E$ 具有有限极限，$\\epsilon$ 是 $I$ 的幂对象成员关系。$s_D$ 与 $\\operatorname{Mem}_D$ 采用该定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$x,y:J\\to I$ 是任意广义元素。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"s_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mem}_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y:J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall x,y\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I))\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dy,x)\\Longleftrightarrow x=y\\bigr],\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal E}(s_D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"s_D\\times\\operatorname{id}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s_Dy,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle y,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_I","display":false},{"tex":"z:J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"z=y","display":false},{"tex":"z=x","display":false},{"tex":"x=y","display":false},{"tex":"s_Du=s_Dv","display":false},{"tex":"u=u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Du,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;s_Dv,u)","display":false},{"tex":"u=v","display":false},{"tex":"s_D","display":false}],"bytes":1841,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]、[[16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-dependent-product]]、[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]、[[16-df-power-object]]、[[16-df-singleton-map]]、[[16-lem-singleton-monic]]、[[16-thm-power-object]]。最小伴随存在性与完整含BC的理解积分别保留；singleton单态性用任意广义元素证明。"}],"outgoing":["ba3b191d87bb028c","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}